WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.812
In long form, the month is stored as a value in a column.

00:00:03.812 --> 00:00:08.642
Laptop January and Laptop February occupy different rows.

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:13.202
This shape is flexible because a new month can simply become another row.

00:00:13.202 --> 00:00:20.892
Long form is common for time-series analysis, plotting, grouping, and tidy analytical workflows.

00:00:20.892 --> 00:00:27.407
Long and wide are not labels for good and bad design; they are shapes suited to different tasks.

00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:32.952
Long data is often easier for grouping, plotting, and scalable storage.

00:00:32.952 --> 00:00:39.177
Wide data is often convenient for human-readable reports or some modeling interfaces.

00:00:39.177 --> 00:00:41.920
Choose the shape required by the next step.
